          216 * ∫ ω, ‖O ω‖ ^ 3 ∂ρ :=
        add_le_add (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hGO hr) hBG
      _ = (896 * r + 216) * ∫ ω, ‖O ω‖ ^ 3 ∂ρ := by ring

