      integral_norm_pow_replacementOriginal_eq hXm k 3
  change
    |∫ α in Real.arcsin ε..Real.pi / 2, F α - R α| ≤
      (16128 * (3 + Real.sqrt standardGaussianFourthMoment)) *
        (d : ℝ) ^ (1 / 4 : ℝ) * (C * β / ε) * βk
